diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 0cd6db5..0fc0999 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -1,4 +1,12 @@
-An HTTP server that routes each request by the method and target in its request line.
+An HTTP server that reads the request line, headers, and a Content-Length body before routing.
+
+`/echo` accepts any method and returns plain text such as `POST /echo`. Query strings are excluded from the routed path. Existing GET routes `/` and `/users/:userId/posts/:postId` remain available.
+
+Malformed requests receive `400 Bad Request`, including invalid request lines, headers, Content-Length values, and truncated requests. Transfer-Encoding is unsupported. Each connection handles one request and closes after the response.
+
+Request lines are limited to 8192 bytes (configurable with `MAX_REQUEST_LINE_BYTES`), and the full header section is limited to 65536 bytes.
+
+Test: `npm test`
 
 Run: `node server.js`
 
